    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d711">

                <pb facs="0882" n="868" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg868"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.21112 RP/8–745: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Wiley</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-07T10:00:00-05:00">August 7, 1945—10
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 4:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1048. Emtel 1041, Aug. 4.<anchor n="55" xml:id="d711-f1"/> Minister of Finance,
                    Santamaria, has just confirmed to the Embassy that an executive resolution has
                    been signed by the Minister of Foreign Affairs and President López ordering
                    liquidation of Axis spearhead firms.</p>
                <p>Minister Santamaria expressed confidence that no further obstacles would remain
                    in the way of prompt liquidation of Axis firms. Text of resolution follows in
                    Embtel 1049.<anchor n="56" xml:id="d711-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wiley</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
